<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Control in Chubb parent firm changes hands.</title>
<headline>Control in Chubb parent firm changes hands.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment holding company Chubb Holdings Ltd said on Monday that Britain's Williams Holdings Plc now held about 75.5 percent of its parent company Chubb Security Plc.</p>
<p>The announcement follows Williams' agreed 1.3 billion sterling bid for Chubb Security Plc.</p>
<p>Chubb Security owns 68.03 percent of Chubb Holdings Ltd's issued share capital.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
